.git
.gitignore
target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.env
.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*password*
**/*token*
**/compose.env
**/data
**/secrets
ffkv-config
tests
benchmarks
.ffkv-*
ffkv-data
ffkv-restored
**/users.acl
# Never drop Rust sources whose names match the secret patterns above
# (for example src/cli/tokenize.rs).
!src/**
